OL,3,AVirgin Media O2 set to cut thousands of
OL,4,Ajobs to reduce costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of Virgin Media O2 staff are
OL,7,Ffacing redundancy as the telecoms firm
OL,8,Fattempts to save money in the face of
OL,9,Fbillions of pounds of debt and tougher
OL,10,Fcompetition.
OL,12,FThe broadband provider has not
OL,13,Ffinalised the number of roles to be cut
OL,14,Fbut it is likely be a sizeable chunk of
OL,15,Fits 16,000-strong workforce, the BBC
OL,16,Funderstands.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
