OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AVirgin Media O2 set to cut thousands of
OL,4,Ajobs to reduce costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FVirgin Media O2 has billions in debt on
OL,7,Fits balance sheet and is tackling both
OL,8,Fsmaller providers as well as giants
OL,9,Flike BT, which has agreed a deal to
OL,10,Facquire rival TalkTalk, which Virgin
OL,11,FMedia O2 has firmly opposed.
OL,13,FThe company declined to comment.
OL,14,FProspect, a union which represents
OL,15,FVirgin Media O2 staff, said the cuts
OL,16,Fwere "disappointing and very
OL,17,Funsettling".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
